,{"href":280},"storage contracts",": uniqueness under concurrency,\ntest\u002Flive separation, omitted versus null updates, and a declined ",[427,929,930],{},"store",[423,932,933,934,937],{},"For ",[924,935,936],{"href":272},"webhooks",", test valid, invalid, stale, and rotated signatures\nusing an independent HMAC signer. Concurrent copies must commit once. A failed\nreaction must roll back rows, audit markers, and outbox work, then succeed on retry.\nAlso test unknown events and out-of-order snapshots. Keep timestamp checks enabled.",[916,939,941],{"id":940},"live-test-mode-workflow","Live test-mode workflow",[943,944,945,957,963,978],"ol",{},[946,947,948,949,952,953,956],"li",{},"Set ",[427,950,951],{},"VATLY_API_KEY"," to a real ",[427,954,955],{},"test_"," key. Use customer and catalogue IDs from\nits storefront and mode. Test keys do not create real charges.",[946,958,959,960,660],{},"Expose your local webhook route through an HTTPS tunnel. Register the public\nURL and save its signing secret as ",[427,961,962],{},"VATLY_WEBHOOK_SECRET",[946,964,965,966,969,970,973,974,977],{},"Pay through a ",[924,967,968],{"href":262},"hosted checkout",". Save the checkout\u002Forder IDs and\nconfirm signed ",[427,971,972],{},"checkout.paid"," and ",[427,975,976],{},"order.paid"," deliveries.",[946,979,980],{},"Check duplicate and failed deliveries. Delete or disable temporary endpoints\nbefore closing the tunnel; record any resources you create.",[423,982,983,986,987,990,991,586,994,990,997,990,1000,1003,1004,1007,1008,1011],{},[427,984,985],{},"vatly.testHelpers()"," exposes ",[427,988,989],{},"advanceRenewal",", ",[427,992,993],{},"forceRenewalPaid",[427,995,996],{},"forceRenewalFailed",[427,998,999],{},"forceOrderPaymentPaid",[427,1001,1002],{},"forceOrderPaymentFailed",", and the\nSDK-style ",[427,1005,1006],{},"fastForwardRenewal","\u002F",[427,1009,1010],{},"simulateOrderPayment",". These mutate account data.\nUse them only with permission and disposable test resources, not existing\nsubscriptions or orders just because the key is in test mode.",[916,1013,1015],{"id":1014},"test-your-edge-runtime","Test your edge runtime",[423,1017,1018],{},"For edge hosts, also run your app in the local edge runtime with its storage adapter.\nNode tests alone do not check edge compatibility.",[423,1020,1021,1022,1028,1029,660],{},"See the ",[924,1023,1027],{"href":1024,"rel":1025},"https:\u002F\u002Fdocs.vatly.com\u002Fguides\u002Ftesting",[1026],"nofollow","testing guide"," and\n",[924,1030,1033],{"href":1031,"rel":1032},"https:\u002F\u002Fdocs.vatly.com\u002Fapi-reference\u002Ftest-helpers",[1026],"Test Helpers API reference",[1035,1036,1037],"style",{},"html pre.shiki code .s7zQu, html code.shiki .s7zQu{--shiki-light:#39ADB5;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-default:#89DDFF;--shiki-default-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic}html pre.shiki code .sMK4o, html code.shiki .sMK4o{--shiki-light:#39ADB5;--shiki-default:#89DDFF;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF}html pre.shiki code .sTEyZ, html code.shiki .sTEyZ{--shiki-light:#90A4AE;--shiki-default:#EEFFFF;--shiki-dark:#BABED8}html pre.shiki code .sfazB, html code.shiki .sfazB{--shiki-light:#91B859;--shiki-default:#C3E88D;--shiki-dark:#C3E88D}html pre.shiki code .spNyl, html code.shiki .spNyl{--shiki-light:#9C3EDA;--shiki-default:#C792EA;--shiki-dark:#C792EA}html pre.shiki code .s2Zo4, html code.shiki .s2Zo4{--shiki-light:#6182B8;--shiki-default:#82AAFF;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF}html pre.shiki code .swJcz, html code.shiki .swJcz{--shiki-light:#E53935;--shiki-default:#F07178;--shiki-dark:#F07178}html pre.shiki code .sbssI, html code.shiki .sbssI{--shiki-light:#F76D47;--shiki-default:#F78C6C;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C}html pre.shiki code .sHdIc, html code.shiki .sHdIc{--shiki-light:#90A4AE;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-default:#EEFFFF;--shiki-default-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#BABED8;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic}html .light .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-light);backgr